msgid "Triton-Ascend FAQ"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend FAQ"

msgid "1. 安装与环境配置"
msgstr "1\\. Installation and environment configuration"

msgid "**Q: 如何正确安装 Triton-Ascend？是否支持 pip 直接安装？**"
msgstr "**Q: How do you correctly install Triton-Ascend? Can you install it directly using pip?**"

msgid "A: 可以直接使用pip 安装"
msgstr "A: You can install it directly using pip."

msgid ""
"pip install triton-ascend\n"
msgstr ""
"pip install triton-ascend\n"

msgid "**Q: 社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend 能否同时存在？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can the community version of Triton and Triton-Ascend coexist?**"

msgid "A: triton-ascend 3.2.0 及以下不可以。需要先卸载社区 Triton，再安装 Triton-Ascend。 triton-ascend 3.2.1 及以上，Triton-Ascend 通过将 Triton 声明为安装依赖来缓解安装覆盖问题。 安装 Triton-Ascend 时会先安装社区 Triton，再由 Triton-Ascend 覆盖同名目录，从而避免后续安装其他依赖 Triton 的软件包时再次安装 Triton 而覆盖 Triton-Ascend。 x86 与 arm 使用不同版本的社区 Triton 安装包的原因是社区从 3.5 版本开始才提供 arm 版本安装包：x86 依赖 triton==3.2.0，arm 依赖 triton==3.5.0。"
msgstr "A: triton-ascend 3.2.0 and earlier versions do not support this. You need to uninstall the community Triton first, and then install Triton-Ascend. For triton-ascend 3.2.1 and later versions, Triton-Ascend mitigates the installation overwrite issue by declaring Triton as an installation dependency. When you install Triton-Ascend, the community Triton is installed first, and then Triton-Ascend overwrites the directory with the same name. This prevents Triton from being installed again and overwriting Triton-Ascend when you install other packages that depend on Triton later. The reason why x86 and arm use different versions of the community Triton installation package is that the community provides the arm installation package only starting from version 3.5. x86 depends on triton==3.2.0, and arm depends on triton==3.5.0."

msgid "注：若安装triton-ascend后，再安装依赖triton的三方件或者triton本身，将覆盖掉已安装的 Triton-Ascend 目录。 此时需要先卸载社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend，再安装 Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr "Note: If you install third-party components that depend on triton or triton itself after installing triton-ascend, this overwrites the installed Triton-Ascend directory. In this case, uninstall the community Triton and Triton-Ascend first, and then reinstall Triton-Ascend."

msgid ""
"pip uninstall triton\n"
"pip uninstall triton-ascend\n"
"pip install triton-ascend\n"
msgstr ""
"pip uninstall triton\n"
"pip uninstall triton-ascend\n"
"pip install triton-ascend\n"

msgid "**Q: 能否在非 Ascend 硬件（如 CUDA AMD）上使用 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can you use Triton-Ascend on non-Ascend hardware (such as CUDA or AMD)?**"

msgid "A: 不可以，只能在 Ascend NPU 硬件环境使用 Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "A: No, you can only use Triton-Ascend in an Ascend NPU hardware environment."

msgid "2. 精度与数值一致性问题"
msgstr "2\\. Precision and numerical consistency issues"

msgid "**Q: NPU 运行结果和 PyTorch/CPU/GPU 参考结果不一致，如何排查？**"
msgstr "**Q: The NPU execution results are inconsistent with the PyTorch/CPU/GPU reference results. How do you troubleshoot this?**"

msgid "A: 用例请参考 [07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](../zh/examples/07_accuracy_comparison_example.md) 调试方法请参考 [解释器模式调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-interpreter-mode)"
msgstr "A: For samples, refer to [07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](../zh/examples/07_accuracy_comparison_example.md). For debugging methods, refer to [Interpreter mode debugging method](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-interpreter-mode)"

msgid "3. 错误代码与异常处理"
msgstr "3\\. Error codes and exception handling"

msgid "**Q: 为什么 kernel 编译时报 MLIRCompilationError？如何定位具体失败的 Pass？**"
msgstr "**Q: Why does kernel compilation report an MLIRCompilationError? How do I locate the specific failed Pass?**"

msgid "A: 请参考 [编译错误调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-compilation-error)"
msgstr "A: Refer to [Compilation error debugging method](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-compilation-error)"

msgid "4. 调试与日志"
msgstr "4\\. Debugging and Logging"

msgid "**Q: 如何开启详细日志输出？TRITON_DEBUG=1 输出在哪？**"
msgstr "**Q: How do you enable detailed log output? Where is the TRITON_DEBUG=1 output?**"

msgid "A: 可以使用 TRITON_DEBUG=1 获取详细的调试转储文件，请参考 [调试转储文件（Dump Files）](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-dump-files)"
msgstr "A: You can use TRITON_DEBUG=1 to obtain detailed debug dump files. For more information, refer to [Dump Files](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-dump-files)."

msgid "**Q: 能否在 kernel 中打印中间张量值？tl.device_print 是否可用？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can you print intermediate tensor values in a kernel? Is tl.device_print available?**"

msgid "A: 可以使用 tl.device_print 打印 kernel 中的张量，请参考 [打印调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-printing)"
msgstr "A: You can use tl.device_print to print tensors in the kernel. For details, refer to [Debug Printing](./debug_guide/debugging.md#debug-printing)."

msgid "5. 开发与贡献"
msgstr "5\\. Development and Contribution"

msgid "**Q: 如何本地构建并测试 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr "**Q: How do you build and test Triton-Ascend locally?**"

msgid "A: 本地构建和测试方法，请参考 [通过源码安装Triton-Ascend](./installation_guide.md#install-from-source)"
msgstr "A: For local build and test methods, refer to [Install Triton-Ascend from source](./installation_guide.md#install-from-source)"

msgid "**Q: 提交 PR 需要通过哪些 CI 检查？**"
msgstr "**Q: Which CI checks do you need to pass to submit a PR?**"

msgid "A: PR 的 CI 检查包括：编码安全与规范检查、开源片段检查、恶意代码检查、编译构建、开发者测试"
msgstr "A: The CI checks for a PR include: code security and specification checks, open-source snippet checks, malicious code checks, compilation and build, and developer tests."

msgid "6. 性能调优"
msgstr "6\\. Performance tuning"

msgid "**Q: 有没有性能分析工具（profiler）可以使用？**"
msgstr "**Q: Is there a performance analysis tool (profiler) available?**"

msgid "A: 有集成性能分析工具（profiler），请参考 [算子性能调优方法](./debug_guide/profiling.md)"
msgstr "A: An integrated performance analysis tool (profiler) is available; for details, refer to [Operator Performance Tuning Method](./debug_guide/profiling.md)."

msgid "7. UB Overflow 常见问题"
msgstr "7\\. Common Issues with UB Overflow"

msgid "**Q: 编译时报 \"UB Overflow\" 错误，如何解决？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to resolve the \"UB Overflow\" error reported during compilation?**"

msgid "A: UB Overflow 是 Triton-Ascend 开发中常见的问题，请参考 [UB Overflow 问题排查指南](./debug_guide/ub_overflow.md) 排查问题。如果不知道如何减小tiling来减少UB占用，可以使用Autotune来自动选择最优配置，Autotune的使用请参考[Triton-Ascend autotune 使用指南](./autotune_guide.md)。 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上可运行的算子迁移到Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品由于UB大小的差异可能导致UB Overflow，如果手动排查不出问题，也可采用Autotune自动选择最优配置。"
msgstr "A: UB Overflow is a common issue in Triton-Ascend development. For troubleshooting, refer to the [UB Overflow Troubleshooting Guide](./debug_guide/ub_overflow.md). If you do not know how to reduce tiling to decrease UB usage, use Autotune to automatically select the optimal configuration. For details about using Autotune, refer to the [Triton-Ascend autotune Usage Guide](./autotune_guide.md). Migrating operators that run on Ascend 950PR&950DT products to Atlas A2 products or Atlas A3 products may cause UB Overflow due to differences in UB size. If manual troubleshooting fails, use Autotune to automatically select the optimal configuration."

msgid "8. Triton 使用限制"
msgstr "8\\. Triton Usage Limitations"

msgid "**Q: Triton Kernel 中指针参数有哪些使用限制？**"
msgstr "**Q: What are the usage restrictions for pointer parameters in a Triton Kernel?**"

msgid "A: Triton-Ascend 编译器假设所有外部输入的指针参数本质上指向不同的内存区域，无法识别指针别名（Pointer Alias）场景。当多个指针参数在运行时实际指向同一块内存，但编译器无法获知这一事实时，可能导致优化失效或运行结果异常。例如："
msgstr "A: The Triton-Ascend compiler assumes that all external input pointer arguments essentially point to different memory regions, and cannot identify pointer alias scenarios. If multiple pointer arguments actually point to the same memory block at runtime, the compiler cannot detect this. This may cause optimization failures or abnormal execution results. For example:"

msgid ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def func(ptr0, ptr1):\n"
"    # load from ptr0 and do something\n"
"    # store to ptr0\n"
"    # load from ptr1 and do something\n"
"    # store to ptr1\n"
"\n"
"in_out_tensor = torch.randn(shape)\n"
"func[grid](in_out_tensor, in_out_tensor)\n"
msgstr ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def func(ptr0, ptr1):\n"
"    # load from ptr0 and do something\n"
"    # store to ptr0\n"
"    # load from ptr1 and do something\n"
"    # store to ptr1\n"
"\n"
"in_out_tensor = torch.randn(shape)\n"
"func[grid](in_out_tensor, in_out_tensor)\n"

msgid "上述代码中 `ptr0` 和 `ptr1` 实际指向同一块内存（即同一个 `in_out_tensor`），但编译器无法识别这种指针别名关系，因此这种同一个张量同时作为多个指针参数传入的写法是不受支持的，对应的 Kernel 将无法启用相关优化。"
msgstr "In the preceding code, `ptr0` and `ptr1` actually point to the same memory (that is, the same `in_out_tensor`). However, the compiler cannot identify this pointer aliasing relationship. Therefore, passing the same tensor as multiple pointer parameters simultaneously is not supported, and the corresponding kernel cannot enable related optimizations."
